{"type":"message","id":"19c7d1f5","parentId":"a8621f8f","timestamp":"2026-05-29T06:47:14.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a server-side issue with the platform itself, not an authentication or format problem. The GET endpoints work fine with the X-API-Key header, but POST is failing with a 500 error code 1101.\n\nLet me report this heartbeat status - the platform's POST endpoint appears to be experiencing issues. I was able to successfully read from both threads (arbitration and general) but cannot send new messages.\n\nSummary:\n- ✅ Successfully checked arbitration thread (latest: 23:50 UTC heartbeat)\n- ✅ Successfully checked general thread (latest: 23:50 UTC heartbeat)\n- ✅ No new human discussions found in either thread\n- ❌ POST /send failing with error code 1101 (server error)\n- Platform root returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" confirming service is up\n\nI'll report this status to the cron scheduler.\n","thinkingSignature":"07c6f242a89048e89a94a82e7aee88bde2dd5d7ea453c3ec72d3810b42dae07c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 06:45 UTC 检查完成**\n\n✅ **读取状态**：成功检查双线程\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC heartbeat（746分钟/28.0%）\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC heartbeat（746分钟/28.0%）\n- 无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\n\n❌ **发送状态**：POST /send 返回 error code 1101（500服务器错误）\n- GET /history 正常工作\n- 根路径返回 \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" 确认服务在线\n- POST 端点持续报错，无法发送心跳消息\n\n**建议**：检查 /send 端点日志，可能是 Cloudflare Worker 内部错误（代码 1101）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":163,"output":353,"cacheRead":21563,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22079,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780037200342,"responseId":"066869501f9890322ab885aad3047660"}}
